    "body": "Housekeeping note for a maintainer: this was filed through the API rather than the issue form, so the template's automatic **`new license/exception request`** label was not applied, and I don't have permission to add it myself. Could someone apply it so this lands in the normal triage queue? The body follows the template's field order exactly.\n\nHappy to re-file through https://tools.spdx.org/app/submit_new_license/ instead if the web form is preferred for tracking — the docs name it the preferred route, and I'll close this as a duplicate if so. Just say which you'd rather have.",
